SUMMARY:Earthshot Innovation Challenge Pitch Competition 
LOCATION:The Pub
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Impact Fund\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 8 spo
 ts left\nStatus: You are Confirmed\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhous
 e.com/events/199492\n\n5:00PM Reception\, 5:30PM Program\nBefore the spotl
 ight turns to the annual Earthshot Innovation Challenge Award Ceremony at 
 the John F. Kennedy Presidential Library this winter\, The 'Quin Impact Fu
 nd invites members to an exclusive first look at the next generation of cl
 imate innovation.\n\nDuring this special preview\, Earthshot Innovation Ch
 allenge semi-finalists will present their breakthrough concepts\, sharing 
 bold ideas designed to address some of the world's most pressing environme
 ntal challenges. Members will hear each pitch\, engage with the ideas\, an
 d cast their votes in real time to select the solution they wish to propel
  into the challenge finals\, securing at least $25\,000 in grant funding\,
  and raising their chances to be awarded the top prize of $100\,000.\n\nTh
 is exclusive event offers a unique opportunity to experience the innovatio
 n process firsthand while helping elevate promising solutions before they 
 take the stage at the formal competition. Be among the first to discover t
 he visionary entrepreneurs shaping a more sustainable future - and play a 
 role in recognizing the ideas with the greatest potential to create lastin
 g impact.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for members only. 
 Complimentary light bites and refreshments will be served. We kindly ask 
 that all cancellations be made at least 24 hours prior to the start of the
  event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/199492
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Impact Fund
END:VEVENT
