SUMMARY: Wines of South America with Amanda Barnes
LOCATION:Lunasol
DESCRIPTION:Category: Food & Beverage\nPrice: $95.00 per person\nAvailabili
 ty: 1 spot left\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhous
 e.com/events/201263\n\n5:30PM Reception\, 6:00PM Dinner\n\nIn celebration 
 of Hispanic Heritage Month\, enjoy an immersive dinner exploring flavor\
 , culture\, and story alongside Master of Wine\, Amanda Barnes. Author of 
 the acclaimed The South America Wine Guide and a leading voice on the regi
 on’s wines\, Barnes will guide members through a thoughtfully curated ta
 sting of exceptional selections from across South America\, each chosen to
  showcase the diversity and character of this dynamic wine landscape.\n\nJ
 ourney from Garzón Pinot Noir Rosé and vibrant whites from Chile\, Urug
 uay\, and Argentina to expressive lighter reds\, before culminating with t
 hree iconic pours: Nicolás Catena Zapata\, Cheval des Andes\, and VIK. P
 aired with a thoughtfully crafted plated dinner\, each wine will reveal th
 e distinctive grapes\, regions\, and traditions shaping South American win
 e today.\n\n*This event is offered at $95 per person\, plus tax\, and is 
 reserved for members only. Tickets are nonrefundable.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/201263
