DESCRIPTION:Category: Member Mixer\, Food & Beverage\nPrice: Free / Include
 d\nStatus: Waitlist Only\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/even
 ts/199238\n\nStep into a lively Saturday brunch designed for members in th
 eir 50s and beyond—where meaningful connections come naturally and conve
 rsation flows as effortlessly as the mimosas. This edition of Serendipity 
