 rt to the day alongside fellow members at a similar stage of life.\n\nThe 
 experience unfolds at an easy\, social pace: a thoughtfully curated\, fami
 ly-style menu paired with subtle conversation prompts designed to spark co
 nnection and keep dialogue flowing. Enjoy a table of pastries\, fresh frui
 t\, and parfaits to begin\, followed by your choice of entrée and generou
 s sides\, with Bloody Marys and mimosas available throughout.\n\nWhether y
 ou’re looking to expand your social circle\, make a new friend\, or simp
 ly enjoy meeting someone unexpected\, it’s a refined\, convivial take on
  brunch at The ’House—welcoming\, engaging\, and designed for great co
 nversation\, new connections\, and a little serendipity.\n\n*Tickets are $
