 h live music\, plenty of good cheer\, and a festive atmosphere made for ga
 thering with fellow members.\n\nMembers will enjoy a complimentary Pub pre
 tzel\, along with Bavarian fare and traditional beer available for purchas
 e à la carte\, bringing a taste of Oktoberfest to The Pub. Whether you ar
 e joining for a stein\, staying for the music\, or making an afternoon of 
 it with friends\, expect a lively celebration of one of fall’s most belo
 ved traditions.\n\nTraditional attire is warmly encouraged\, good cheer is
  essential\, and a spirited Prost! is all but guaranteed.\n\n*This event i
