 ests. With an open-play format and an easygoing pace\, the afternoon is de
 signed for those who enjoy the strategy and social ritual of bridge - with
 out the formality of tournament play.\n\nBest suited to members with a wor
 king knowledge of the game\, the afternoon invites you to settle in for a 
 few hands\, reconnect with familiar faces\, and meet new ones across the t
 able. \n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for members\, plus on
