SUMMARY:'Quin Chat: Equity in Breast Cancer Care
LOCATION:Scottie's
DESCRIPTION:Category: Health & Wellness\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 110 spo
 ts left\nStatus: Waitlist Only\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.co
 m/events/203298\n\n7:00PM Reception\, 7:30PM Discussion\n\nPresident\, CEO
 \, and founder of Gretta Enterprises\, and breast cancer survivor\, Gretta
  Monahan joins Meredith Mendelson\, Executive Director of The Ellie Fund
 \; and Dr. Rachel Freedman\, MD\, MPH\, medical oncologist and clinical re
 searcher at Dana Farber Cancer Institute\, for a discussion informed by l
 ived experience\, patient advocacy\, emotion and practical support\, and m
 edicine. Personal\, thoughtful\, and refreshingly candid\, the conversati
 on moves beyond awareness to consider what it really means to show up - fo
 r ourselves\, for the people we love\, and for communities navigating brea
 st cancer every day.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for memb
 ers only. Complimentary light bites and refreshments will be served. We ki
 ndly ask that all cancellations be made at least 24 hours prior to the sta
 rt of the event.
